1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.nermo.org/slekt/d0024/g0000005.html#I14241
2 CONT
2 CONT     * RESIDENCE: Bosatt i Aukra (Agerøe), Romsdal
2 CONT
2 CONT     * OCCUPATION: Sognepr. Aukra 1572-1601
2 CONT
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1545, (ca. 1515 ?)
2 CONT
