0 @I6000000002017898070@ INDI
1 NAME Jon Trondson /Benkestok/
2 GIVN Jon Trondson
2 SURN Benkestok
1 NAME Jon Trondson /Benkestok/
2 GIVN Jon Trondson
2 SURN Benkestok
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Meløy
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1530
2 ADDR
