2 CONT  Nordstrom, Byron J. (2000). Scandinavia Since 1500. U of Minnesota Press. pp. 36. ISBN 978-0-8166-2098-2. Retrieved 15 April 2009.
2 CONT  Stagg, Frank Noel (1956). East Norway and its frontier: a history of Oslo and its uplands. Allen & Unwin. pp. 103–105. Retrieved 15 April 2009.
2 CONT  Littell, Eliakim; Littell, Robert S. (1893). The Living Age ... Littell, Son & Company. pp. 168–172. Retrieved 15 April 2008.
2 CONT  Stewart, Alan (2003). The cradle king: the life of James VI & I, the first monarch of a United Great Britain. Macmillan. pp. 111–112. ISBN 978-0-312-27488-7. Retrieved 15 April 2008.
2 CONT  David Masson, Register of the Privy Council: 1585-1592, vol. 4 (Edinburgh, 1881), pp. 444-5.
