2 CONT Anne Ahlefeldt was also known as Anne Sophiesdatter after her mother, Sophie Gyldenstierne, who was in charge of the tenantcy from 1529. Appointed together with her first husband, Reinwald von Heiersdorf. Later married Jens Nielse
2 CONC n Rotfeldt. She lived (1515-50).
