1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p><span style="color: #211e1e; font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">B&oacute;ndi &aacute; Sau&eth;afelli og &aacute; B&aacute;r &iacute; Eyrarsveit. &bdquo;Bj&oacute; aldrei vel, &thorn;&oacute; atgj&ouml;rfism
2 CONC a&eth;ur, en barnmargur, seldi jafnan jar&eth;ir s&iacute;nar og anda&eth;ist &iacute; Otrardal &ouml;rsnau&eth;ur&ldquo;, segir Esp&oacute;l&iacute;n. Sag&eth;ur hafa &aacute;tt 31 barn. Hyllti konung &aacute; Grundar&thorn;ingst
2 CONC a&eth;, Sn&aelig;f. 1649. Geti&eth; &iacute; jar&eth;abr&eacute;fi fr&aacute; 1651. Var ekki l&ouml;gr&eacute;ttuma&eth;ur eins og segir &iacute; &Iacute;&AElig;.II.305. Esp&oacute;l&iacute;n segir hann f&ouml;&eth;ur tveggja J&oa
2 CONC cute;na, sem annars eru sag&eth;ir synir J&oacute;ns &aacute; Lambavatni &Aacute;sbjarnarsonar.</span></p>
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Bóndi í Bár og sennilega á Sauðafeli.  Hann var vel hagur og góð skytta en lítt upp á búsýslu og mjög barnmargur. Eyddist hans fé því hann átti um 31 barn með konum sínum... 
2 CONT
2 CONT A farmer in Bár and probably at Sauðafell, Dalasýsla. He was a good hunter and a poet but not such a good farmer and had many children with his wives and eventually he became poor. Married twice and had ca 31 children with them. 
