2 CONT Name: John BERRYMAN Given Name: John Surname: BERRYMAN Sex: M Birth: Abt 1585 in Berrie, Upcott, Devonshire, England Birth: Abt 1585 Immigration: 1654 Virginia Note:
2 CONT Note:  Mary Love Berryman notes that John Berryman/Berreman came to Virgin ia as a headright of Major Miles Carey of Westmoreland Co, VA by 1654. Joh n's first wife and the mother of his children died around 1677/78. The on ly sur
2 CONC viving child of this marriage was Benjamin, born 7 Dec 1670, died 17 29, VA; married 1. Sarah, 2. Elizabeth NEWTON  John was a farmer and raised tobacco. He apparently owned and operated a m ill located near the head of the Upper 
2 CONC Machodoc Creek in Westmoreland Coun ty, VA. He married Jane BUTLER, the widow of Thomas BUTLER, in 1678. The re were no children by this marriage. Jane married John Harvey before Benj amin came of age.  Part of the inventory accou
2 CONC nt of John's estate included burial charges f or "Mr Berriman and two sons." John and his sons must have died about t he same time in 1679/1680 in Westmoreland County, VA.
