2 CONT Hans Olafsen Teiste Bjelland was born circa 1540 at Bjelland, Kvinnherad, Norway. He married Brynhild Torsdtr Benkestokk Hananger, daughter of Tord Tronsen Benkestokk Jordanger and Kirstine Jensdtr Skjolderband.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynhild Torsdtr Benkestokk Hananger married Hans Olafsen Teiste Bjelland, son of Olav Jonsen Teiste Kroken and Marina Kristoffersdtr Bjelland. She lived in 1604 at Hananger, Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. She lived in 1610 at Lunde, 
2 CONC Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. She died
2 CONT
2 CONT circa 1639. Her married name was Friis Hananger. She married Nils Jacobsen Friis Landvig. She 29.16. nevnt Nes I.345. Lista II. 435, 83.
2 CONT
2 CONT He Eiendommer etter Lister lens jordebok:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lista:
2 CONT
2 CONT Øvre Kalleberg 1/2 hud Udal 1/2 hud, Vigan 1/2 hud, Austhassel4 1/2 hud, Nesheim 4 1/2 hud,
2 CONT
2 CONT Buland 4 huder Fjellestad vestre 3 huder Fjellestad østre 4 huder, Grimsby 6 huder, Stokke 5 huder,
2 CONT
2 CONT Spind:
2 CONT
2 CONT Farbrot 2 huder Eigeland 1 hud, Sævig med Nes ødegard 2 huder, Udestad 1/2 hud, Ersåger 3/4 hud.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal:
2 CONT
2 CONT Treland 1 1/2 hud Handeland 1 hud, Erikstad 3 huder, Mydland 1 1/2 hud.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hidra:
2 CONT
2 CONT Håland 2 huder Ågenes 2 huder 3 engelske, Bukkstad 3 huder, Våge 3 1/2 hud, Itland 1 hud, Håland lille 1 hud.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvinesdal:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sørhelle 1 hud
2 CONT
2 CONT I tillegg kom setegardene Hananger og Lunde
2 CONT
2 CONT in 1618. He died in 1624 at Hananger, Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Nes I. 345. Lista II. 435 Hans Theiste
2 CONT
2 CONT Død 1624.
2 CONT
2 CONT Søn af Oluf Theiste og Maren Kristoffersdatter (Rustung).
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Theiste til Bjelland.39,25.
2 CONT
