2 CONC irst had wounded Borgar Vetrlidesson Hem with  a lance and insulted his wife Aslaug. The trail that followed the next year showed that both parties belonged the lower nobility.
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/><br/>
2 CONT <br/> Borgar Vetrlidesson was killed at the Lund Farm, Sandsvær  1336, we don’t know if this was the same person; that’s however not unlikely
