1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Til Lydum Gunde Nielsen (Lange, 3 Roser) Lange''' was born circa 1400 in Lydum, Ribe, Danmark. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31832775 Niels Thomesen (Lange, 3 Roser) Lange til Lydum] and [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC rofile-31832787 Anne Henriksdatter Reventlow]. He was a Rigsråd, Godsejer, Rigsraadsmedlem, høveds­mand, Lensmand, Ridder. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunde married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31832759 Bege Madsdatter Giordz] circa 1429 in Lydum, Denmark. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1430 [https://www.geni.com/profile-31831214 Til Lydum og Hennegaard Niels Gundesen (Lange, 3 Roser) Lange];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34703149145 Hans Gundesen (Lange, 3 Roser) Gundesen Lange]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1477 in Varde Købstad and was buried in Varde Kirke. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT --------------- ejer af Lydurn­gaard i Lydum Sogn, ridder 1443, senere rigsråd, blev 1442 høveds­mand på Trøjborg, senere andre steder.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Gund Nielsen Lange was a knight. You will find his family pedigree here on the RoskildeHistorie.dk site (secondary source data): http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/////adel/Lange/Lange.htm
