2 CONT ===John Thomas Mann===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 17 Oct 1495 in Canterbury, Kent, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Le Manns and Johanne (Thretheway) Le Manns
2 CONT
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT [spouse(s) unknown]
