2 CONT
2 CONT 140672. Fartegn Filippusson LOSNA was born in 1315 in Sulen.Yttre-Sogn.Norway.. He died in 1400 in Bergen.Hordaland.Norway.. Fartegn married Fredriksdatter N.N. [Parents] 
2 CONT
