1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 8788. Peder Pedersson STAUR-BOSERØD was born calculated 1470 in Denmark. He died in 1512 in Holmgaard.Sjelland.Denmark. Peder married Boel Henriksdatter BUNDEN-LILLESCHOFF. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8789. Boel Henriksdatter BUNDEN-LILLESCHOFF was born in Lille-Skov.Lolland.Denmark. She died in 1516 in Holmgaard.Sjelland.Danmark. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Boel giftet seg med Peder Pederssøn Staur Senior ca. 1537 i Danmark. (Peder Pederssøn Staur Senior ble født ca. 1512 i Holmgård, Sjelland, Danmark.)
