1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JEAN MOWAT===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Mowat is the daughter of John Mowat of Hugoland and his wife Christian Stewart [https://archive.org/stream/TheCountyFamiliesOfTheShetlandIslands/The%20County%20Families%20of%20the%20Shetland%20Islands#page/n108/mode/1up Th
2 CONC e County Families of the Shetland Islands]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the Register of Sasines for Shetland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On 5 March 1623 Jean Mowat and her husband David Heart sold the twelve merk land of Brewik, in the Shetland parish of Northmaven, to Mitchell Sinclair of Aeth and his wife Agnes Mowat. This land was given to Jean Mowat by her d
2 CONC eceased father John Mowat of Hwgoland. [http://www.vsnrweb-publications.org.uk/Orkney%20and%20Shetland%20records/Orkney%20and%20Shetland%20Records%20Vol%20II.pdf Shetland Sasines]'''
