2 CONT     Klaus lived at Mosafinn, of which he was the owner since about 1655, and he was a powerful man.  He inherited a great deal of real estate from his father; he was the bailiff and in addition was 'protector' of the Crown propert
2 CONC ies at Voss.  Two of their daughters married farm boys from Voss and after them we have a wide-spread linage in the district.  It was called the 'bailiff lineage'.
