2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [1] In 1524, the family was represented by a John Bettys and his son, also named John. The latter John had one son named Richard, who by his wife Alice had five children: George, Thomas, John, Elizabeth and another John called Joh
2 CONC n the younger. George, the eldest son of Richard married Agnes Mans and was the father of Richard, Syeth, Bridget, Maryona, George and John.
2 CONT
