2 CONT '''     Thomas Fulford was born circa 1551 at of Great Fulford, Devonshire, England.1 He married Ursula Bamfield''', daughter of Richard Bamfield and Elizabeth Sydenham, '''circa 1574 at Devonshire, England.'''1 '''Thomas Fulford 
2 CONC died on 31 July 1610 at Great Fulford, Devonshire, England.'''1
