1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Family and Education==
2 CONT bap. 1 Sept. 1583, 1st s. of Thomas Fulford of Gt. Fulford and Ursula, da. of Richard Bampfield of Poltimore, Devon.1 educ. Brasenose, Oxf. 1599; M. Temple 1601.2 m. 14 Sept. 1601, Elizabeth, da. and coh. of Bernard Samways of Win
2 CONC terbourne St. Martin and Toller Fratrum, Dorset, 7s. (3 d.v.p.) 6da. (2 d.v.p.).3 kntd. 26 Feb. 1605;4 suc. fa. 1610.5 admon. 2 May 1664.
2 CONT
